{"k":"2:55","t":"And [recall] when you said, \"O Moses, we will never believe you until we see Allāh outright\"; so the thunderbolt took you while you were looking on.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"2:56","t":"Then We revived you after your death that perhaps you would be grateful.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"2:57","t":"And We shaded you with clouds and sent down to you manna and quails, [saying], \"Eat from the good things with which We have provided you.\" And they wronged Us not - but they were [only] wronging themselves.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":57,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":1,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}